329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 282 0 R
/T (The Tradewinds Solutions Marketplace is a digital environment of post-competition video pitches. The video solutions housed within the marketplace have been assessed through competitive procedures that conform to the competition requirements of 10 USC 4021, 10 USC 4022, 10 USC 4023, 10 USC 3458, FAR/DFARS Part 35, and DFARS Subpart 212.70, and are readily available to be viewed, selected, negotiated, and awarded by DoW activities \(and federal agencies that share the relevant authorities underpinning the TSM program\), without further competition. The Marketplace provides a venue for government organizations to search, view, review, compare, contrast, contact, negotiate, and procure AI/ML, digital, and data capabilities through rapid acquisition pathways, including relevant pathways described under the Adaptive Acquisition Framework. For industry, academia, and individual solution providers, the Marketplace is a valuable tool to promote AI/ML, digital, and data solutions, products, software, and services to the DoW in an environment with multiple rapid acquisition pathways. )
/E (The Tradewinds Solutions Marketplace is a digital environment of post-competition video pitches. The video solutions housed within the marketplace have been assessed through competitive procedures that conform to the competition requirements of 10 USC 4021, 10 USC 4022, 10 USC 4023, 10 USC 3458, FAR/DFARS Part 35, and DFARS Subpart 212.70, and are readily available to be viewed, selected, negotiated, and awarded by DoW activities \(and federal agencies that share the relevant authorities underpinning the TSM program\), without further competition. The Marketplace provides a venue for government organizations to search, view, review, compare, contrast, contact, negotiate, and procure AI/ML, digital, and data capabilities through rapid acquisition pathways, including relevant pathways described under the Adaptive Acquisition Framework. For industry, academia, and individual solution providers, the Marketplace is a valuable tool to promote AI/ML, digital, and data solutions, products, software, and services to the DoW in an environment with multiple rapid acquisition pathways. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
